# Netlify rewrites. A 200 (rewrite) keeps the URL as /gift while serving gift.html —
# so the permanent gift link is clean AND its Open Graph card unfurls from the same URL.
# NOT a 301/302: link scrapers follow redirects and would lose the unfurl artwork.
/gift   /gift.html   200
/faq    /faq.html    200
/terms  /terms.html  200

# The ambassador "portal" is a Phase-2 dashboard that doesn't have a backend yet.
# Until it's real, send anyone who finds the URL to the application page (302 = temporary,
# so it can come back when the dashboard ships) rather than a dead sign-in that does nothing.
# The trailing "!" forces the redirect to win over the existing portal.html file
# (Netlify skips a redirect when a real file sits at the path, unless it's forced).
/portal       /affiliate.html   302!
/portal.html  /affiliate.html   302!
